{"title": "Nahaküsimustik | Koosta oma isiklik seerumiplaan | Tava Labs", "description": "Vasta mõnele kiirele küsimusele ja koosta oma isiklik plaan PDRN Brightening Serum ümber. Üks seerum, kaks korda päevas, sinu naha ja eesmärkidega sobitatud.", "contentHtml": "\n\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <header class=\"top\">\n    <div class=\"wordmark\">TAVA<small>LABS</small></div>\n    <span style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);\">PDRN Brightening Serum</span>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"progress-zone\" id=\"progressZone\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"progress-meta\">\n      <button class=\"backbtn\" id=\"backBtn\" type=\"button\">&larr; Tagasi</button>\n      <span id=\"stepLabel\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bar\"><div id=\"barFill\"></div></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 1 · HOOK -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"hook\" data-progress=\"6\" data-step-label=\"6 küsimust sinu plaanini\">\n    <img class=\"bottle\" src=\"§IMG0§\" alt=\"Tava Labsi PDRN Brightening Serum pudel\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Koosta oma asutaja hooldusplaan</p>\n    <h1>Üks seerum. Kaks korda päevas. <em>30 päeva.</em></h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Sinu järgmine kohtumine algab sinust. Vasta mõnele kiirele küsimusele ja me koostame sinu isikliku 30 päeva plaani PDRN Brightening Serum ümber, üks samm hommikul päevaks valmistumiseks ja üks samm õhtul selle lõpetamiseks. Tellimus, mille saad igal ajal peatada või tühistada.</p>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Koosta minu plaan</button>\n    <p class=\"note\">PDRN Brightening Serum · 1 fl oz (30 ml) · Tehtud kaks korda päevas kasutamiseks</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 2 · Q1 GOAL -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"goal\" data-progress=\"14\" data-step-label=\"6 jäänud\">\n    <h2>Mida soovid järgmise 30 päeva jooksul kõige rohkem?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"goal\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"radiance\"><span class=\"t\">Sära ja kiirgus</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"fine_lines\"><span class=\"t\">Peened jooned</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"hydration\"><span class=\"t\">Sügav niisutus</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"even_tone\"><span class=\"t\">Ühtlane toon</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 3 · INTERSTITIAL 1 -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"notalone\" data-progress=\"24\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Sa ei ole üksi</p>\n    <h2 id=\"naTitle\">Sa ei ole üksi.</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\" id=\"naBody\"></p>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Jätka</button>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 4 · Q2 SKIN TYPE -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"skinType\" data-progress=\"34\" data-step-label=\"5 jäänud\">\n    <h2>Kuidas sinu nahk tavaliselt keskpäevaks tundub?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"skinType\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"dry\"><span class=\"t\">Kuiv</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"oily\"><span class=\"t\">Rasune</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"combination\"><span class=\"t\">Seganahk</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"sensitive\"><span class=\"t\">Tundlik</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"not_sure\"><span class=\"t\">Pole kindel</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 5 · Q3 CONCERN -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"concern\" data-progress=\"46\" data-step-label=\"4 jäänud\">\n    <h2>Ja mis on praegu sinu peamine mure?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"concern\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"dullness\"><span class=\"t\">Tuimus</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"fine_lines\"><span class=\"t\">Peened jooned</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"uneven_tone\"><span class=\"t\">Ebaühtlane toon</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"texture\"><span class=\"t\">Kare tekstuur</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"dryness\"><span class=\"t\">Kuivus</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 6 · INTERSTITIAL 2 · FORMULA MATCH -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"match\" data-progress=\"56\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Sinu valemivaste</p>\n    <h2>Pudeli sees, sinu vastustega sobitatud</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\" style=\"margin-bottom:2px;\">Üks kindel valem — siin on, mis selles kõnetab seda, mida sa meile just ütlesid.</p>\n    <div class=\"cardbox\" id=\"matchBox\"></div>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Jätka</button>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 7 · Q4 SENSITIVITY -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"sensitivity\" data-progress=\"64\" data-step-label=\"3 jäänud\">\n    <h2>Kas sinu nahk on varem tugevatele toodetele reageerinud?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"sensitivity\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"often\"><span class=\"t\">Jah, kergesti</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"sometimes\"><span class=\"t\">Mõnikord</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"never\"><span class=\"t\">Harva</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 8 · Q5 ROUTINE -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"routine\" data-progress=\"74\" data-step-label=\"2 jäänud\">\n    <h2>Milline näeb sinu rutiin täna välja?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"routine\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"cleanser_only\"><span class=\"t\">Ainult puhastusvahend</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"few_products\"><span class=\"t\">Mõned tooted</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"full_routine\"><span class=\"t\">Täielik rutiin</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 9 · Q6 ROUTINE TIMES -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"times\" data-progress=\"84\" data-step-label=\"Viimane küsimus\">\n    <h2>Millal sa seda kasutad?</h2>\n    <label class=\"f\">Hommik</label>\n    <div class=\"chips\" data-time-chips=\"amTime\">\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"06:30\">6:30 AM</button>\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"07:30\">7:30 AM</button>\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"08:30\">8:30 AM</button>\n    </div>\n    <input type=\"time\" id=\"amCustom\" aria-label=\"Kohandatud hommikuaeg\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n    <label class=\"f\">Õhtu</label>\n    <div class=\"chips\" data-time-chips=\"pmTime\">\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"21:00\">9:00 PM</button>\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"22:00\">10:00 PM</button>\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"22:30\">10:30 PM</button>\n    </div>\n    <input type=\"time\" id=\"pmCustom\" aria-label=\"Kohandatud õhtuaeg\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n    <div style=\"height:22px\"></div>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Jätka</button>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 10 · EMAIL -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"email\" data-progress=\"92\" data-step-label=\"Peaaegu valmis\">\n    <h2>Kuhu peaksime sinu 30 päeva plaani saatma?</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Sinu plaan läheb sinu postkasti. Kasuta sama e-posti aadressi, kui rakenduse alla laadid — nii tunneb rakendus sinu ära ning sinu vastused, plaan ja tellimus ootavad sind seal.</p>\n    <label class=\"f\" for=\"emailInput\">E-posti aadress</label>\n    <input type=\"email\" id=\"emailInput\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\">\n    <div class=\"banner err\" id=\"emailErr\">See e-posti aadress ei tundu täielik — kontrolli seda ja proovi uuesti.</div>\n    <div style=\"height:18px\"></div>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" id=\"emailNext\">Näita minu plaani</button>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 11 · PLAN REVEAL — treatment preview -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"plan\" data-progress=\"97\" data-step-label=\"Sinu plaan\">\n    <div class=\"planhero\">\n      <p class=\"plan-eyebrow\">Sinu hoolduse eelvaade</p>\n      <p class=\"plan-brand\">Tava Labs</p>\n      <h2 id=\"planTitle\">PDRN Brightening Serum</h2>\n      <div class=\"plan-bottle\"><img src=\"/assets/products/pdrn-bright-serum/view-1-mockup.jpg\" alt=\"PDRN Brightening Serum pudel\"></div>\n      <p class=\"basedon\">Valitud sinu eesmärkide põhjal:</p>\n      <div class=\"goalchips\" id=\"goalChips\"></div>\n      <p class=\"priceline\">Plaanid alates <strong>$39/month*</strong></p>\n      <p class=\"fineprint\">*Makstakse igakuiselt. Peata või tühista igal ajal.<br>Ühekordne pudel $49.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cardbox\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">\n        <p style=\"font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:#B78B45;margin:0 0 8px\">SINU ESIMENE NÄDAL</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px\">Sinu vastused kaardistasid juba sinu rutiini esimese nädala. Pärast kahte esimest päeva on jäänud viis päeva ja esimene päev algab hetkel, kui sinu seerum teele pannakse.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;background:#123B2C;color:#D8C19A;font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">1. päev</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;background:#123B2C;color:#D8C19A;font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">2. päev</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">3. päev</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">4. päev</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">5. päev</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">6. päev</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">7. päev</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cardbox detailscard\">\n      <h3>Seerumi üksikasjad</h3>\n      <p>Üks seerum. Kaks korda päevas. 30 päeva.</p>\n      <div class=\"stats\">\n        <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"sk\">Liik</span><span class=\"sv\">Helendav seerum · 1 fl oz</span></div>\n        <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"sk\">Kasutamine</span><span class=\"sv\">Kaks korda päevas</span></div>\n        <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"sk\">Plaan</span><span class=\"sv\">30 päeva</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"planBox\"></div>\n      <details class=\"acc\" open>\n        <summary>Aktiivsed koostisosad</summary>\n        <div class=\"ingcards\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Aktiivsed koostisosad\">\n          <div class=\"ingcard\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"name\">PDRN</span><span class=\"sub\">Polydeoxyribonucleotide</span><img class=\"ingimg\" src=\"/assets/ingredients/ingredient-pdrn.png\" alt=\"PDRN seerumi tekstuur\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"benefit\">Helendava, kiirgava välimusega naha jaoks</p></div>\n          <div class=\"ingcard\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"name\">Acetyl Hexapeptide-8</span><span class=\"sub\">Peptiid</span><img class=\"ingimg\" src=\"/assets/ingredients/ingredient-peptide.png\" alt=\"Acetyl Hexapeptide-8 seerumi tekstuur\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"benefit\">Siledama välimusega naha jaoks</p></div>\n          <div class=\"ingcard\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"name\">Sodium Hyaluronate</span><span class=\"sub\">Hüaluroonhape</span><img class=\"ingimg\" src=\"/assets/ingredients/ingredient-ha.png\" alt=\"Sodium Hyaluronate seerumi tekstuur\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"benefit\">Sügava, täidlase niisutuse jaoks</p></div>\n          <div class=\"ingcard\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"name\">Panthenol</span><span class=\"sub\">Pro-vitamiin B5</span><div class=\"ingtex\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"benefit\">Pehme, mugava naha jaoks</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"ingnote\">Kosmeetiline seerum välispidiseks kasutamiseks. Ainult välispidiseks kasutamiseks. Väldi silmi. Ärrituse tekkimisel lõpeta kasutamine.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details class=\"acc\">\n        <summary>Kuidas kasutada</summary>\n        <p>Kanna 2–4 pumpa puhtale, kuivale nahale, kaks korda päevas. Hommikul jätka niisutava kreemi või päikesekaitsekreemiga.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details class=\"acc\">\n        <summary>Hea teada</summary>\n        <p>Ainult välispidiseks kasutamiseks. Väldi silmi. Ärrituse tekkimisel lõpeta kasutamine. Hoia lastele kättesaamatus kohas. Ära kasuta kahjustatud nahal. Hoia jahedas, kuivas kohas.</p>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"featureband\">\n      <h3>Tutvu oma <em>seerumiga</em></h3>\n      <div class=\"feature\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/products/pdrn-bright-serum/view-1-mockup.jpg\" alt=\"PDRN Brightening Serum pudel\">\n        <span class=\"callout c1\">Esinduslikkus ja sära</span>\n        <span class=\"callout c2\">Sügav niisutus</span>\n        <span class=\"callout c3\">Peened jooned</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"featuretitle\">Tegelikud tulemused</h3>\n    <div class=\"results\">\n      <figure class=\"resultcard\"><div class=\"resultimg\"><img src=\"/assets/before-after/D0DBB2D8-601B-46E8-BE29-A068C5DAF345.jpeg\" alt=\"Enne ja pärast PDRN Brightening Serum kasutamist\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><span>Enne</span><span>Pärast</span></figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"resultcard\"><div class=\"resultimg\"><img src=\"/assets/before-after/IMG_3056.jpeg\" alt=\"Enne ja pärast PDRN Brightening Serum kasutamist\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><span>Enne</span><span>Pärast</span></figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"resultcard\"><div class=\"resultimg\"><img src=\"/assets/before-after/IMG_3057.jpeg\" alt=\"Enne ja pärast PDRN Brightening Serum kasutamist\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><span>Enne</span><span>Pärast</span></figcaption></figure>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"resultsnote\">Tulemused on igaühel erinevad.</p>\n    <div class=\"stickybar\">\n      <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Jätka selle plaaniga</button>\n      <button class=\"altlink\" type=\"button\" data-next>Vaata teisi võimalusi</button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 12 · OFFER + CHECKOUT -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"checkout\" data-progress=\"99\" data-step-label=\"Ostu vormistamine\">\n    <h2>Alusta oma 30 päeva</h2>\n    <div class=\"banner demo\" id=\"demoBanner\" hidden><strong>Demoost — tasu ei võeta.</strong> See leht pole veel makse- ega täitmissüsteemiga ühendatud. Allolev nupp kontrollib sinu andmeid ja koostab täpse tellimuse kasuliku koormuse, et saaksid täpselt näha, mis saadetaks.</div>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"purchaseType\" data-no-advance=\"1\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"subscribe\"><span class=\"price\">$39</span><span class=\"t\">Telli ja säästa</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"one_time\"><span class=\"price\">$49</span><span class=\"t\">Ühekordne</span></button>\n    </div>\n    <form id=\"shipForm\" novalidate>\n      <div class=\"grid2\">\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"firstName\">Eesnimi</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"firstName\" autocomplete=\"given-name\"></div>\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"lastName\">Perekonnanimi</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"lastName\" autocomplete=\"family-name\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"f\" for=\"address1\">Tänava aadress</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"address1\" autocomplete=\"street-address\">\n      <label class=\"f\" for=\"address2\">Korter, sviit jne. <span class=\"opt\">(valikuline)</span></label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"address2\" autocomplete=\"address-line2\">\n      <div class=\"grid2\">\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"city\">Linn</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"city\" autocomplete=\"address-level2\"></div>\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"stateCode\">Osariik</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"stateCode\" autocomplete=\"address-level1\" placeholder=\"CA\" maxlength=\"2\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid2\">\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"zip\">Sihtnumber</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"zip\" autocomplete=\"postal-code\" inputmode=\"numeric\"></div>\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"countryCode\">Riik</label>\n          <select id=\"countryCode\"><option value=\"US\" selected>Ameerika Ühendriigid</option><option value=\"CA\">Kanada</option><option value=\"GB\">Ühendkuningriik</option><option value=\"AU\">Austraalia</option></select>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"f\" for=\"phone\">Telefon <span class=\"opt\">(valikuline, tarneuudiste jaoks)</span></label>\n      <input type=\"tel\" id=\"phone\" autocomplete=\"tel\">\n      <div class=\"banner err\" id=\"shipErr\"></div>\n      <div style=\"height:20px\"></div>\n      <button class=\"cta\" type=\"submit\" id=\"buyBtn\">Alusta minu tellimust — $39</button>\n      <p class=\"note\" id=\"payNote\">Tellimus uueneb iga 30 päeva järel hinnaga $39. Peata või tühista igal ajal.</p>\n    </form>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 13 · THANK YOU -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"thanks\">\n    <img class=\"bottle\" src=\"§IMG1§\" alt=\"Tava Labsi PDRN Brightening Serum pudel\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Tellimus vastu võetud</p>\n    <h2>Sinu standard <em>algab nüüd.</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"banner demo\" id=\"thanksDemo\" hidden><strong>Demoost — tasu ei võetud.</strong> Sinu tellimuse kasulik koormus salvestati sellesse brauserisse, et saaksid täpselt kontrollida, mida reaalne versioon saadab.</div>\n    <div class=\"cardbox\" id=\"thanksBox\"></div>\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:24px;\">Sinu ost järgneb sulle rakendusse</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">Sinu plaan elab Tava rakenduses, igapäevaste hommiku- ja õhtumärgetega ning sinu seeria ja saadetise jälgimisega. Rakendus pole veel App Store'is. Pärast ostu vormistamist annavad sinu kinnitusleht ja e-kiri sulle <strong>lunastuskoodi</strong>. Kui rakenduse installid, logi sisse ja sisesta see kood ning sinu plaan, vastused ja tellimus on juba seal. Uuesti ostma ei pea.</p>\n    <!-- The app is not published yet, so there is deliberately no store\n         button here. The claim code on checkout/success.html (and in the\n         confirmation email) is the handoff. Add the real App Store link\n         next to the claim code once the app is listed. -->\n    <a class=\"cta\" href=\"/checkout/success\" id=\"appStoreBtn\">Vaata minu lunastuskoodi pärast ostu</a>\n    <p class=\"note\" id=\"carryLine\"></p>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer>Tava Labs · The Science of Attractive Health · Küsimused? talia@tavalabs.app</footer>\n</div>\n\n\n"}